    "publication_date": "2026-10-17",
    "description": "<p>Missy, RUO: a self-contained, offline browser application for independent processing of IXO, EDS/EDT and RDML experiment run files, quality-control exploration and data audit. Latest application is index.html; download and open locally, or use <a href=\"https://mihaiionitabio-alt.github.io/lc480-ixo-qc-exportv2/\">the live page</a>.<br><br>The only file needed is:</p>\n<table class=\"ui striped table files fluid open\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ten wide\">\n<div><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/23437639/files/index.html?download=1\">index.html</a></div>\nmd5:3bf60501a9eeb08166df9bb024fd8495\n<div class=\"ui icon inline-block\">&nbsp;</div>\n</td>\n<td>2.2 MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>the rest is documentation (pdf and TeX file), page screenshots, validation and raw file generation script,<br><br></p>\n<table class=\"ui table\">\n<tbody class=\"\">\n<tr class=\"\">\n<td class=\"ten wide\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/23437639/draft/files/synthetic_EDS_2026-10-17.zip/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">synthetic_EDS_2026-10-17.zip</a>\n<div class=\"ui text-muted\">md5:8cf74b028b974ce26d0231bdaa60fc11</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"two wide\">6.91 MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"ui table\">\n<tbody class=\"\">\n<tr class=\"\">\n<td class=\"ten wide\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/23437639/draft/files/synthetic_RDML_2026-10-17.zip/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">synthetic_RDML_2026-10-17.zip</a>\n<div class=\"ui text-muted\">md5:93a9d24516b06622704f8081e478168f</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"two wide\">3.52 MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"ui table\">\n<tbody class=\"\">\n<tr class=\"\">\n<td class=\"ten wide\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/23437639/draft/files/synthetic_IXO_2026-10-17.zip/co